  "description": "The ultimate .NET notification library for Enterprise applications. Unified API for sending Email (SMTP, SendGrid, Mailgun), SMS & WhatsApp (Twilio, Vonage), Chat (Slack Block Kit, Microsoft Teams Cards, Telegram), and Real-time WebSockets (SignalR).\n\t\t\tFeatures include \"Fire-and-Forget\" background queuing, rich content templates, modular architecture, and thread-safe execution. Perfect for alerting, OTPs, and system notifications.",
